  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KNCF-Satoyama Initiative Promotion Program COMDEKS Phase 4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The COMDEKS-4 is supported with a total funding of approx. $7 million from Japan, this C/S is an additional funding from the Keidanren Nature Conservation Fund of $300 million (approx. USD $2.3 m). The public-private partnership with Japan; Ministry of Environment and Keidanren Nature Conservation Fund was announced this week at the CBD COP15 as major contribution of Japan for the implementation of the Post-2020 Global Biodiversity Framework and further promote landscape and seascape approaches</narrative>
  </description>
